  html+=`<p class="detail-footnote">${f.type==='photo'?'Drag this photo onto a chain label, an “Add photos” box, or a space between photos.':f.type==='chain'?'Drop a photo at any point in this chain. Add a junction after any photo to branch from there.':'Removing this structure returns its photos to your tray. You can undo any change.'}</p></div>`;
